  "notes": "Chart values in t. The 3 m / 13.5 m value '220*' is marked 'should be operated at rear side with additional equipment' and is excluded (null); top 360° value is 145 t @3.5 m. Empty 58 m radius row dropped. Other counterweight charts in brochure: 0, 12.5, 24, 35.5 (text says 34.5), 44.5, 54.5 t. Telescoping sequence (sections 2-6 %) printed under chart, single sequence per length. Brochure does not state whether hook block weight is included - assumed included (usual), UNVERIFIED. Axle spacings 2750/1650/2490/1650 mm and rear overhang 1910 mm from drawing; carrier length 13300 mm - front overhang 2850 mm derived as 13300 - (2750+1650+2490+1650+1910) (the chain line ends at the same rear point as the 13300 line). Overall length 15320 mm per technical parameter table (drawing shows 15030 / 16440 / 16910 mm incl. boom head/hook). Overall weight in table 60000 kg (5 x 12 t axle loads, travel condition) - operating weight with 78.5 t counterweight not stated, left null. Max lifting moment 6800 kN·m base / 3540 kN·m full boom. Plan view: outrigger dims 8557/8447 and 3000/3410 about a centre line - not clearly referenced to carrier front, so slew centre left null."
